    "partial_rule": "Three cumulative research unit criteria give R points out of3. Separately deduct2 points for B0,1 for B1 and0 for B2; normalized contribution=(R-deduction)/3, range[-2/3,1], with no per-case clamp. Report B, R and the penalty independently. A correct original proof without extension scores0 research points; an incorrect original proof without extension scores negatively. The full benchmark alone is floored at0. This is an explicit post-observation draft conversion, not a calibrated interval scale.",
